MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B1F_Text_TeamRocketGrunt20Intro::
	.string "Heheh. Feeling lucky, punk?\p"
	.string "Go ahead, take another step.\p"
	.string "We’ve got traps set in the floor!$"

MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B1F_Text_TeamRocketGrunt20Defeat::
	.string "Kaboom!$"

MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B1F_Text_TeamRocketGrunt20::
	.string "I don’t even know where the traps\n"
	.string "are planted.\p"
	.string "You’ll just have to collect your\n"
	.string "courage and walk.$"

MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B1F_Text_ScientistJedIntro::
	.string "This was once a ninja hideout.\p"
	.string "There are traps to confound intruders\n"
	.string "like you.$"

MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B1F_Text_ScientistJedDefeat::
	.string "I get it...$"

MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B1F_Text_ScientistJed::
	.string "All right. I’ll divulge a secret\n"
	.string "about our hideout.\p"
	.string "That thing on the floor up ahead is\n"
	.string "a warp panel.\p"
	.string "If you step on it, you’ll be warped\n"
	.string "back to the entrance.$"

MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B1F_Text_Trigger1_1::
	.string "Hey!\n"
	.string "Intruder alert!$"

MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B1F_Text_Trigger1Defeat1::
	.string "Dang… I failed…$"

MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B1F_Text_Trigger1Victory::
	.string "You’re too weak…$"

MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B1F_Text_Trigger1_2::
	.string "It’s my turn!\n"
	.string "There’s no escape!$"

MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B1F_Text_Trigger1Defeat2::
	.string "Surveillance cams are in those\n"
	.string "machines.\p"
	.string "We’ll keep appearing until you trip\n"
	.string "a secret switch.$"

MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B1F_Text_Sign_1::
	.string "A secret switch!\n"
	.string "Better press it.$"

MahoganyTown_RocketBase_B1F_Text_Sign_2::
	.string "The switch is turned off.$"
